{
  "title": "Sacral Insufficiency Fracture",
  "url": "https://www.orthobullets.com/spine/12297/sacral-insufficiency-fracture",
  "subtitle": "Updated: May 16 2026",
  "sections": [
    {
      "text": "summary",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Sacral insufficiency fractures are fragility fractures of the sacral spine that occur more commonly in elderly women with osteoporosis",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Diagnosis can be made with inlet and outlet radiographs of the pelvis. CT or MRI may be helpful for fracture characterization and operative planning",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "5",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Treatment is usually observation and pain control. Surgical management is indicated for patients with progressive pain and/or difficulty ambulating who fail nonoperative treatment",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "5",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Epidemiology",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Incidence",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "1% of women >55 y/o",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "increases with age",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "**estimated to increase by 23% each year**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Demographics",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
